35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,The timing shows 102 minutes total. The chat shows conflict starts with reminders.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mio,,The calendar shows two people are away a lot. The kitchen watch shows only three cook.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Victoria,,The note says permanent division led to silence. The chat shows reminders cause fights.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,"The receipts show 2,300 yen monthly. The chat shows we fight over unpaid items.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The grout fails in eleven days. ""Done"" means different things to each of us.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, if two are away, the load shifts. That explains the conflict.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, yes. And the kitchen work is concentrated. We need to split by use.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
