45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,We need a system that accounts for absence and specific standards.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mio,,I propose a base fee plus a usage-based add-on for the kitchen.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"I worry about the ""add-on"" feeling like a penalty. Let's keep it simple.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,A shared fund for supplies is essential. Who manages it?,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"If we define ""done"" clearly, the grout won't be an issue.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,I support a clear standard and a fund. I will vote for the option that includes both.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Mio,,I support the usage-based idea. It feels fairer given the calendar data.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Victoria,,I support the option that prioritizes communication over rigid rules.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Rin,,I support the option that creates a shared supply fund.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I support the option that defines specific cleaning standards.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
